  "method": "Real App.PreparePostListForClient over 60 stored posts with default priority/acknowledgement reads and explicitly configured SiteURL. Identical benchmark/store code; baseline restores only post_metadata.go through Go overlay. Cases cover plain text, cached images on an external host or the configured site (including a subpath), a same-site non-permalink URL and an actual cached permalink. Link previews are disabled while permalink previews stay enabled. Setup/cache warming are outside timing. Timed loops validate images and permalink targets; image cases reject network fetches during timing. Alternating paired processes.",
